      "avatar": "./assets/members/member-01.jpg?v=20260917192332",
      "side": "right",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "问答-子非鱼：知识付费行业判断\n\nhttps://my.feishu.cn/wiki/VN0JwC6V8iF8lwktjGicQ2iRnAf?from=from_copylink",
      "links": [],
      "media": null,
      "redacted": false
